{"id":"n71690-2-8","stage":3,"title":"이루어지다 · 实现","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71690-2-8-1","ko":"유민이가 국가대표가 되었다면서?","zh":"听说裕敏入选国家队了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민이가","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"유민이가","audio":"/audio/9f714db1c17c8ecf0221.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민이가","audio":"/audio/9f714db1c17c8ecf0221.mp3"}},{"text":"국가대표가","meaning":"国家队队员","explanation":"국가：国家；대표：代表；国家대표 合起来指代表国家参赛的人，即国家队队员。","readings":[{"term":"국가","audio":"/audio/10a6c77fd1f313a630c4.mp3"},{"term":"대표","audio":"/audio/ddae8811c0aada12d04e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62382","senseId":"1","lemma":"국가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"66263","senseId":"2","lemma":"대표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"국가대표가","audio":"/audio/002a5067f08515261af0.mp3"}},{"text":"되었다면서?","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되었다면서","audio":"/audio/530ccd1f8a6e477009c7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"10a6c77fd1f313a6","term":"국가","zh":"国家队队员","audio":"/audio/10a6c77fd1f313a630c4.mp3","entryId":"62382","definition":"国家队队员","pronunciation":["국까"]},{"id":"ddae8811c0aada12","term":"대표","zh":"代表","audio":"/audio/ddae8811c0aada12d04e.mp3","entryId":"66263","definition":"代表","pronunciation":["대ː표"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f2b436f0f7c62c9498a9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71690-2-8-2","ko":"응. 어릴 적부터 꿈꿔 왔던 일이 이루어졌어.","zh":"是啊，她从小的梦想终于实现了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readin